## Why This Is Asked
Tests practical concurrency control with per-key ordering and degradation strategies under load.

## Key Concepts
- Bounded queues and backpressure mechanisms
- Per-room FIFO semantics and ordering guarantees
- Fair scheduling across multiple rooms
- Graceful degradation when overwhelmed

## Code Example
